Jesus is a adventure, drama, tv movie film directed by Roger Young.

2
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:18,000
Jesus, a carpenter living a simple life, discovers
his destiny as the biblical Messiah.

3
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:54,000
Jesus, played by Jeremy Sisto.

